# Lead form endpoint — where contact / start / audit submissions are POSTed as JSON.
# Leave empty during development: submissions are simulated and logged to the console.
#
# Works with any JSON-accepting endpoint, e.g.:
#   Formspree:   https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Web3Forms:   https://api.web3forms.com/submit   (also needs an access_key field)
#   Own backend: https://api.minterest.nl/leads
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill it in.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
